  "title": "Wedding Planning Sign-In Sheet Form",
  "subtitle": "Control vendor and event-crew access with arrival, assigned zone, issued property, briefing, departure, and exception handoffs in one record.",
  "description": "An original wedding vendor and crew access sheet, not a guest attendance list. It connects each arrival to an approved supplier role, workspace, venue contact, equipment or access property, briefing status, check-out, and unresolved access exception.",
  "use_case": "Use at the designated wedding supplier entrance for planners, production crews, decorators, photographers, rental teams, and other approved workers. Do not collect guest details; close after access property is reconciled and late departures or unresolved exceptions are handed to venue operations.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
